  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab\n2019-2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic Crew Cab\n2010-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 3500 Crew Cab\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit: YITAMOTOR side steps are specifically built for 2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab & 2019-2024 Ram 1500 Classic Crew Cab & 2010-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 3500 Crew Cab. Please check the Cab size picture before ordering\nUtility & Sharp Design: The 3.5-inch drop-down side steps facilitate easier entry and exit while providing sufficient ground clearance for all road conditions\nBuilt to Last: These nerf bars feature a triple-layered black powder coating for enhanced anti-slip, wear-resistant, rust-resistant, and UV-resistant performance; The unique panel structure also promotes efficient fuel consumption\nHeavy-Duty Construction: Made from heavy-duty carbon steel, these side rails are cast into a stylish triangular tube structure for immense sturdiness, boasting a load capacity of up to 400 pounds\nNo-drill Installation: The package includes 8 brackets, necessary hardware, and installation instructions; The no cutting, no-drilling installation can be quickly completed within 20 minutes (Note:2009-2012 models may require drilling)\nProfessional installation recommended",
